      "writtenOn": "2022-07-01T19:05:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "ha sorry, I now realize the issue here. Is this option preferred over hiding the vendor hook definition behind `CONTIG_ALLOC`?\n\nAlso, any chance the reviewer was meant to be carlosgalo@ instead?",
      "parentUuid": "4133b907_4796a6f5",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 36,
